	(text "Job of the MCU is to divide the 1 PPS signal from PTP\nby the FPS to generate the frame trigger signal.\n\nOptionally the MCU can also generate the STROBE_EN signal\nif we don't want to use the strobe output on the camera\nsensor."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
